## Notes

- The first builder attempt created `BPC_ReactivePoint` through the generic `create_blueprint` command, which produced an Actor Blueprint for this parent-class case. The runner now uses Unreal Python `BlueprintFactory(parent_class=SceneComponent)` and replaced only that Phase-owned incorrect asset.
- UE 5.6 Python protects direct SCS template access for the BoxComponent. The Phase 1 shell stores the intended extent in `ReactiveCollectionExtent`; detailed component-template tuning can happen when the collection graph is authored.
- No `/Game/_MCP_Temp` assets were promoted. The only temp use was a deleted SceneComponent Blueprint canary.

